  "instructions": [
    "Grate half of one onion and slice the remaining onions.",
    "Cook the sliced onions slowly in part of the butter until deeply caramelized.",
    "Mix the beef with grated onion, nutmeg, cornstarch, water, salt, and pepper.",
    "Shape the mixture into six patties and score a light grid on each surface.",
    "Brown the patties in the remaining butter, then finish them gently until cooked through.",
    "Serve the karbonader topped with the caramelized onions."
